# Finder-style duplicates ("supervisord 2.conf", "0006_..._constraint 3.py").
# ~90 of them were reaching the image. They are not merely dead weight: most
# are mode 0600 while the container runs as `ibgateway`, and Django's migration
# loader imports every .py in a migrations package, so the image failed at
# startup with
#   PermissionError: '/app/gateway_service/migrations/0003_..._and_more 2.py'
# A readable one is worse -- a duplicated migration is a second graph node
# claiming the same migration name.
#
# Every file these patterns exclude was verified to have its original present.
**/* [0-9].*
**/* [0-9]
